<title>KENYA: Kenyan coffee auction postponed until Wednesday.</title>
<headline>Kenyan coffee auction postponed until Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kenya's weekly coffee auction, usually held each Tuesday, has been postponed to Wednesday this week as Monday was a public holiday in Kenya, auction officials said.</p>
<p>-Nairobi Newsroom +254-2 330-261</p>
</text>
